16:42: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in an attribute value yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
17:17: an element literal inside a Go expression is not supported in an attribute value yet; build it in a Go function and call that
18:11: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in a spread yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
19:27: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in an attrs literal value yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
20:13: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in a conditional-attribute condition yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
20:39: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in an attribute value yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
21:19: an f literal inside a Go expression is not supported in a switch header yet; assign it to a variable in a {{ }} block first
